"><mxPoint x="512" y="792"/><mxPoint x="1495" y="792"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="_auto50" value="telemetry 10 Hz → executor" style="html=0;rounded=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.7;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ttx" target="exe"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1495" y="88"/><mxPoint x="1057" y="88"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="3 Deployment" name="3 Deployment"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="_auto1" value="3 · Deployment: what runs where" style="text;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=20;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="0" width="1400" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="_auto2" value="rates, ports, model files and power per device · (new) = not built yet" style="text;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#666666;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="32" width="1500" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rb3_b" value="OS: Qualcomm Linux / Ubuntu&#10;Process: jero-brain (brain/live.py) (new)&#10;&#10;NPU (HTP)&#10;• Whisper base.en / small: speech → text&#10;• ModernBERT int8: text → intent + slots&#10;CPU&#10;• Silero VAD · openWakeWord (always on)&#10;• Piper TTS&#10;• skill executor · Jero link client&#10;&#10;I/O: USB lapel mic · booth speaker&#10;Net: → robot UDP 5005, commands 20 Hz&#10;   ← robot UDP 5006, telemetry 10 Hz (new)&#10;Files: whisper/* · intent.onnx (+ QNN context)&#10;   skills.yaml · ~/.config/jero/link.key&#10;Power: 12 V adapter (mains)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;html=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3C6EB4;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=44;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="70" width="520" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rb3" value="RB3 Gen 2 · QCS6490 · brain (booth)" style="rounded=0;html=0;fillColor=#3C6EB4;strokeColor=#3C6EB4;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="70" width="520" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pi_b" value="OS: Duck image v0.2.3 (Raspberry Pi OS)&#10;Service: jero-walk.service → robot/jero_walk.py&#10;   venv open-duck-mini-runtime · ONNX Runtime (CPU)&#10;Policy: walk.onnx, obs 101 → 14 actions @ 50 Hz&#10;&#10;Servos: /dev/ttyACM0 · Waveshare adapter · 1 Mbps&#10;   14× STS3215-C018 · IDs 10–14, 20–24, 30–33&#10;IMU: I²C-1 · MPU6050 0x68 (or BNO055 0x28)&#10;Feet: GPIO 22 / 27 (pull-up, active low)&#10;Extras: eyes GPIO 23/24 · projector GPIO 25&#10;   antennas PWM GPIO 12/13 · MAX98357A I²S amp&#10;Gamepad: Bluetooth (Xbox layout; PS4 mapping to do)&#10;&#10;Net: UDP 5005 in (signed commands, TTL 500 ms)&#10;   UDP 5006 out (telemetry 10 Hz) (new)&#10;Files: walk.onnx · duck_config.json · imu.json · link.key" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;html=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5A9A4F;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=44;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="70" width="520" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pi" value="Pi Zero 2 W · on the robot" style="rounded=0;html=0;fillColor=#5A9A4F;strokeColor=#5A9A4F;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="70" width="520" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pw_b" value="3S Li-ion (11.1 V nominal, 12.6 V full)&#10;→ BMS → main switch, then two branches:&#10;   • servo adapter → 12 V servo bus (14 servos)&#10;   • UBEC 5 V / 3 A → Pi header pin 2 (+) / pin 6 (−)&#10;Check before first power-on: 5.0–5.2 V at the Pi, 11–12.6 V at the adapter" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;html=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5A9A4F;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=44;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="440" width="520" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pw" value="Robot power" style="rounded=0;html=0;fillColor=#5A9A4F;strokeColor=#5A9A4F;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="440" width="520" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="gpu_b" value="Env: uv · JAX cuda12 · mujoco_playground (pinned)&#10;Policy: Open_Duck_Playground: MJX + Brax PPO&#10;   training/train.sh → runs/&lt;run&gt;/*.onnx&#10;Intent: HF Transformers · ModernBERT-base fine-tune&#10;   → intent.onnx → Qualcomm AI Hub compile&#10;   → QNN context binary for QCS6490&#10;Tools: TensorBoard · eval_mujoco.sh&#10;Out: deploy_policy.sh (scp → Pi) · intent bundle → RB3" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;html=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8E6BAA;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=44;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="70" width="480" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="gpu" value="GPU training server" style="rounded=0;html=0;fillColor=#8E6BAA;strokeColor=#8E6BAA;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="70" width="480" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lap_b" value="brain/teleop.py · tools/estop.py&#10;telemetry monitor (new)&#10;MuJoCo digital twin: jero_walk.py --sim (new)&#10;SSH to Pi and RB3 · runs the brain in sim mode&#10;Net: UDP 5005 out (teleop / estop) · 5006 in" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;html=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B8A000;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=44;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="320" width="480" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lap" value="Ops laptop" style="rounded=0;html=0;fillColor=#B8A000;strokeColor=#B8A000;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="320" width="480" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rtr_b" value="2.4 GHz SSID (Pi Zero 2 W is 2.4 GHz only)&#10;Static IPs: RB3 .10 · Pi .20 · laptop .30&#10;No internet needed at the venue&#10;Never join the venue Wi-Fi; keep the link signed" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;html=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=44;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="440" width="520" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rtr" value="Dedicated Wi-Fi router (travel router)" style="rounded=0;html=0;fillColor=#999999;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="440" width="520" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="_auto9" value="commands 20 Hz →&#10;← telemetry 10 Hz&#10;(via router)" style="html=0;rounded=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;startArrow=block;startFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="rb3_b" target="pi_b"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="_auto10" value="" style="html=0;rounded=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A